    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The town of Addington was named after its first postmaster, James P. Addington, in January 1896.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10,
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Addington%2C_Oklahoma"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Economic hardships from the Great Depression and Dust Bowl drove many families to abandon their homes in Addington during the 1930s.",
